# Never commit key material dropped into the source dir. Secrets belong in the
# macOS Keychain (service "chezmoi") — see run_once_before_01-setup-keychain.sh.tmpl.
# chezmoi ignores source entries starting with "." (except .chezmoi*), so this
# file is git-only and is never applied to $HOME.
.env.key
*.key
*.pem
